    <string name="sn_help">How snippets work</string>
    <string name="sn_help_message">Type the trigger of a snippet in the editor, then choose it from the completion list.\n\nIn the code:\n$0 — where the cursor ends up\n${1:name} — inserted as “name” and selected, ready to type over\n$1 — an empty placeholder; the same number repeats the same text\n\\$ — a literal dollar sign\n\nA tab at the start of a line is one indent level (spaces if the editor indents with spaces). Lines after the first keep the indentation of the line where you typed the trigger.</string>
